+// Changed 2026-10-07 for thegrandpricks.com/games/duke3d/ (GPL-2.0 section 2a): Web_Look
+// adds the page's touch look-pad movement to the same accumulator SDL mouse motion goes
+// into, so a thumb turns and aims exactly like the mouse (mouseReadPos only hands it to
+// the game while the mouse is grabbed, i.e. in play). Otherwise as in eduke32-wasm v0.2.4.
+extern "C" EMSCRIPTEN_KEEPALIVE void Web_Look(int32_t dx, int32_t dy)
+{
+    g_mousePos.x += dx;
+    g_mousePos.y += dy;
